{
  "slug": "crab-and-avocado-salad",
  "title": "Crab and Avocado Salad",
  "blurb": "A light salad of crab meat tossed with avocado, lime and warm spices, served on crisp lettuce leaves.",
  "steps": [
    "Drain the crab meat well and pick through to remove any shell fragments.",
    "Halve the avocados, remove the stones and scoop the flesh into a bowl, then cut into small chunks.",
    "Add the crab, lime juice, cumin, paprika and olive oil to the bowl and gently fold everything together.",
    "Finely chop the red onion and roughly chop the coriander, then stir both through the crab mixture.",
    "Separate the lettuce leaves, wash and pat dry, then arrange on serving plates.",
    "Spoon the crab and avocado mixture onto the lettuce leaves and serve straight away."
  ],
